{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00492","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 六 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 祀九宫贵神乐章 豫和 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崇崇泰坛，灵具临兮。\n铿鍠大乐，振动心兮。\n神之降矣，卿云郁兮。\n神之至止，清风肃兮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}